id: pm-rust-oracle-unset
title: Support explicit unset scope in published admission oracle comparisons
description: ""
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[3]: admission,"gh:unbraind/pm-rust#122",oracle
created_at: "2026-11-08T03:07:06.170Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-10T20:03:46.521Z"
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: Published CLI-driven fixture creates and previews use explicit unset parent and assignee rather than placeholder tokens; Native admission matches the new published oracle without inferring ambient focus or accepting unsupported relationship mutations; Focused tests and behavioral revert prove compatibility on the pinned and proposed oracle versions without changing dependency pins
comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-08T03:08:23.108Z",pi-agent,"Verified failing PR #122 at job 127715288185: SDK create and previewItemMutations now reject parent and assignee placeholder strings. A real no-git oracle probe accepts unset=[parent,assignee] and rejects the old sentinels. Migrate the canonical native admission request to explicit unset fields, refuse supplied scope and unsupported clear operations, update all CLI-driven fixtures, and compare against both the unchanged pinned oracle and the proposed 2026.11.2 oracle. Dependency manifests remain unchanged."
  "2026-11-08T03:27:27.566Z",pi-agent,"Focused native tests pass 23 of 23 and integration tests pass 12 of 12 against the pinned oracle. A disposable behavioral revert of prepare_create fails the new explicit-unset regression (exit 101), and the fixed function passes it. Testing the proposed oracle then exposed a separate published preview change: configured closure creates with active roles are admitted without a close reason. Such closure operations are explicitly outside the native scalar contract, which retains its close_reason_required refusal. Preserve that behavior and assert both unsupported closure forms independently instead of making the supported-slice parity claim cover them. Convert the existing oracle harness to TypeScript and include it in the harness typecheck."
  "2026-11-08T03:32:05.903Z",pi-agent,"The migrated TypeScript driver passes strict harness typecheck. Against the proposed 2026.11.2 SDK it passes 108 supported admission cases, both JSON and TOON renderers, plus 12 identity-path fixtures. Both configured closure forms retain independent native close_reason_required assertions. The unchanged pinned SDK also passed the 23 native unit and 12 integration tests before migration; a targeted run of the typed oracle integration is verifying the final driver. The dependency manifest and lockfile remain unchanged. The closure-preview divergence is retained separately in pm-rust-oracle-close-preview."
  "2026-11-08T04:08:00.423Z",pi-agent,"The typed oracle harness lives beside the pinned oracle package and uses the public SDK type import, so both runtime and declarations resolve that package version rather than an ancestor installation. The existing guarded SDK loader is retained, and the harness typecheck includes the moved driver."
  "2026-11-08T04:41:06.176Z",pi-agent,"Final focused evidence: 23 native admission unit tests pass, the 12-test admission integration suite passes, and the moved public-import oracle integration passes 1 of 1 on the unchanged pin. The proposed 2026.11.2 SDK passes strict typecheck and 108 supported oracle cases plus 12 identity fixtures through the same driver. Both configured closure creates and updates retain independent native refusal assertions. The isolated prepare_create behavioral revert fails and the fixed function passes. Full npm/Bun aggregate gates remain queued; no dependency pin or threshold changes were made."
  "2026-11-08T06:16:41.600Z",pi-agent,"Focused regression, local typecheck and isolated behavioral revert pass. Full npm and Bun release checks remain required at unchanged thresholds; final-head CI is the full gate and is not yet confirmed. The serial local release queue continues separately. Supported oracle comparisons pass on both pinned and proposed SDKs; native-only closure refusals and existing main-only tracker-history advisories remain separate follow-ups."
  "2026-11-08T06:16:53.154Z",pi-agent,"Review handoff: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/155. Final CI is visible at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/155/checks. Focused regression, local typecheck and behavioral revert pass. Full npm/Bun gates are pending final-head CI confirmation, not approved. All tracker writes are completed before final-head CI observation. Release this agent claim for orchestrator verification; the item stays in progress."
  "2026-11-10T18:36:48.160Z",codex-smallfix-1110,"Read both complete CodeRabbit findings for PR #155 after merging main. Verify existing-create unset admission and standalone crash-check oracle installation; add focused regressions and revert proofs, then run bounded full native tests, harness checks and four-dimensional LLVM coverage. Leave the item open and release the claim after recording evidence."
  "2026-11-10T18:37:57.589Z",codex-smallfix-1110,"Both findings reproduced before fixes: cargo test --locked --lib admission_existing_create_requires_unset failed 0 passed/1 failed at invalid unset must refuse demo-existing; node --test --test-concurrency=2 scripts/crash-install.test.mts failed 0 passed/1 failed at locked oracle and harness must install before typecheck. Those same tests remain as revert proofs: restoring the old admission flow or old crash-check recipe reproduces the respective failure. Move exact unset validation ahead of all create adoption and make crash-check depend on locked oracle-install with bounded offline-preferred npm installs."
  "2026-11-10T18:43:21.271Z",codex-smallfix-1110,"Fixed-side focused results: admission filter passed 27/27 through pm test --run --only-last --progress with two Rust test threads and two build jobs; standalone crash installation regression passed 1/1. Strict all-target/all-feature Clippy and changelog:check passed. Full native suite and standalone crash-check runtime tests are still running; no full-suite claim yet."
  "2026-11-10T18:47:54.504Z",codex-smallfix-1110,"Standalone just crash-check passed end to end: strict harness typecheck and ESLint passed, runtime tests 89 passed/0 failed/0 skipped/0 cancelled, then history-prefix and evidence-commit gates passed. Locked oracle and harness npm installs used --prefer-offline --maxsockets=2. No lockfile or oracle version changes."
  "2026-11-10T19:15:19.226Z",codex-smallfix-1110,"Bounded full native run is still active with two test threads and two build jobs. Completed targets include library 397/397, binary unit 41/41, admission integration 12/12, claim/release 27/27, CLI dispatch 17/17, close 6/6 and orientation 32/32; no failures or ignored tests reported so far. Pagination is running. These are partial results, not a full-suite certification; timeout remains 2700 seconds."
  "2026-11-10T19:22:49.574Z",codex-smallfix-1110,"Full native acceptance completed within timeout 2700: cargo test --locked --all-targets --all-features passed 734 tests across 34 targets, with 0 failures and 0 ignored, using RUST_TEST_THREADS=2 and CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 plus the locked required published CLI. The documented nightly LLVM branch coverage command is now running with the same worker and timeout limits; all four coverage totals remain to be read."
  "2026-11-10T20:03:22.696Z",codex-smallfix-1110,"Instrumented full suite also passed 734/734 with no failures or ignored tests. The unmodified build.rs MSVC branch was the only initial gap under cargo-llvm-cov 0.8.7; all src files were 100%. Two exact-output checks of the existing instrumented build-script binary with synthetic GNU/MSVC target environments cover that branch. Regenerated whole-report totals: lines 16890/16890, functions 1751/1751, regions 27338/27338, branches 3764/3764, all 100%. No coverage scope or threshold changed. Follow-up pm-rust-build-script-coverage tracks adding this platform coverage to the standard aggregate gate; its unsupplemented command still has the build-script gap."
  "2026-11-10T20:03:45.036Z",codex-smallfix-1110,"Final verification: both requested findings fixed; each regression failed against the original implementation and passed after the fix. Focused admission 27 passed, install-order regression 1 passed, standalone crash-check 89 passed, native full 734 passed, instrumented full 734 passed; zero failed/ignored/skipped in completed suites. Clippy, fmt, harness typecheck, ESLint and changelog:check passed. Final whole LLVM report is 100% lines/functions/regions/branches after the linked two-case build-script supplement. Follow-up pm-rust-build-script-coverage remains open for integrating the supplement into the standard aggregate command. Releasing the claim without closing this item."
